### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Inspect unassigned replica shards and the cluster node count. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Insufficient eligible nodes, allocation constraints or disk watermarks.

### Fix
Restore replica capacity or adjust the intended replica policy for this deployment.

### Verify
Replica shards are assigned and cluster health becomes green. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
